    <string name="google_hint">Each step can use Google\'s ML Kit or the free engines. ML Kit\'s scanner needs Google Play services and shows its own screen (the language is then chosen in the review); its reader knows the Latin script only (Russian is read by Tesseract). It sends usage statistics to Google, never your documents.</string>
